From a64f01ad8eb8e6192de8a2f00dc1b311ea7142a6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Luma <luma@simplyluma.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 14:52:10 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 54/88] power: supply: max77779-charger: temperature-banded
 charging profile

Optional per-board profile: temperature bands with a charge current and float voltage each, input limit from TCPM, battery temperature from up to two gauges (the hotter one). Values are capped at 1.5 A input, 1 A charge, 4.40 V; outside the bands charging pauses with the buck still on. Without a profile the conservative defaults stay. Comet gets the bands from its vendor google,battery profile.
---
 .../boot/dts/exynos/google/zumapro-comet.dts  |  21 +-
 .../exynos/google/zumapro-pixel-common.dtsi   |   4 +-
 drivers/power/supply/max77779_charger.c       | 296 +++++++++++++++++-
 3 files changed, 305 insertions(+), 16 deletions(-)

